Forked at upstream version 1.5.15. The skill-discovery and SKILL.md
frontmatter-parsing logic in bin/skills-json.mjs is a clean-room reimplementation
that follows the algorithms and data model of upstream's src/skills.ts,
src/frontmatter.ts, and src/types.ts, adapted for JSON-first output with no
